sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Developer
    participant CLI as CLI / Web UI
    participant Loop as Loop Engine
    participant State as Workspace State
    participant Adapter as Adapter Plane
    participant Tool as External Tool
    participant Runtime as Runtime

    U->>CLI: start or resume flow
    CLI->>Loop: load loop intent and budget
    Loop->>State: read LOOP-STATE, memory, skills
    Loop->>Adapter: prepare tool-ready context
    Adapter->>Tool: send session prompt or task
    Tool->>Runtime: run tools and edit workspace
    Runtime->>State: write session, memory, artifacts
    Runtime->>Adapter: stream updates and approvals
    Adapter->>Loop: translate events into loop state
    Loop->>State: update task status, results, lessons
    Loop->>CLI: report outcome, next step, cost
    CLI->>U: show concise flow result
